			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T05:15:32Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1238,
				21
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add WorkbenchContextKey, WorkbenchExtension, WorkbenchLayout, and WorkbenchProgress services\n\nAdd four new workbench-tier Effect-TS service layers bridging VS Code's native workbench services:\n\nWorkbenchContextKeyService:\n- Manages context key values (Get/Set/Reset) and context expression evaluation\n- Reads from globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__.ContextKey bridge\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchContextKeyBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchContextKeyEvalFailed\n\nWorkbenchExtensionService:\n- Extension activation and snapshot management\n- Provides Snapshot (all extensions), Activate, ActivateByEvent, OnExtensionsChange stream\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchExtensionBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchExtensionActivationFailed\n\nWorkbenchLayoutService:\n- Controls workbench part visibility (ActivityBar, Sidebar, Panel, StatusBar, etc.)\n- Provides Snapshot (visibility map), SetVisible, Toggle, Changes stream\n- Includes WorkbenchLayoutPartId mapping and WorkbenchLayoutAllParts constant\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchLayoutBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchLayoutToggleFailed\n\nWorkbenchProgressProblem:\n- Add Problem ADT for progress task failures\n\nAlso completes WorkbenchEditorService with the Live implementation bridging to VS Code's editor service for pane management (Active, Open, CloseActive, OnActiveChange).\n\nAll services follow the established Wind pattern with BridgeShape (upstream typed interface), Service (abstract contract), Tag (Context.Tag for DI), Problem (ADT for errors), and Live (runtime bridge implementation).",
			"SHA": "12507057c6b0b468fc31d6be9947288bbad4858c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T05:12:25Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1200,
				10
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add WorkbenchActivity and WorkbenchEditor services\n\nAdd two new workbench-tier Effect-TS service layers bridging VS Code's native activity and editor services:\n\nWorkbenchActivityService:\n- Manages activity badges for view containers, views, accounts, and global activity\n- Provides ShowBadge (disposable badge with count/text/priority) and Clear operations\n- Reads from globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__.Activity bridge\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchActivityBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchActivityRefused\n\nWorkbenchEditorService:\n- Bridges VS Code's native editor service for pane management\n- Provides Active (current editor snapshot), Open, CloseActive, and OnActiveChange stream\n- Open accepts resource URI with options for preserveFocus, preview, pinned, columnIndex\n- OnActiveChange returns Stream of WorkbenchEditorChangeEvent with previous/current snapshots\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchEditorBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchEditorOpenFailed, WorkbenchEditorCloseFailed\n\nBoth services follow the established Wind pattern with BridgeShape (upstream typed interface), Service (abstract contract), Tag (Context.Tag for DI), Problem (ADT for errors), and Live (runtime bridge implementation).",
			"SHA": "91507efe0c4833704c297dd4d8f1c69dfca985a6"
		},
